sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as User Admin
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>UserDialog
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>UpdateUserAccountBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>UpdateUserAccountController
  participant User as «entity»<br/>User
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: edit an account's name, phone and email
  UI->>B: PUT /api/admin/users/{id} (JWT)
  B->>C: update(Integer userId, AdminUpdateUserRequest request)
  alt email used by another account
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>User: emailTakenByOther()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C->>User: save()
  User->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>User: rows
  User-->>C: result
  C-->>B: AdminUserResponse
  B-->>UI: 200 OK JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end